Your bru() call uses the “domain” a regiment, which has no effect for non-point process models. Also, the CORRect syntax depends on the storage type of your data if it’s sf are you sp or neither.
If it’s st, change “main=coords” to “main=geometry”, and change “data=list(…” to “data=df”, where “df” is the name of your sf object.
Finn

